DESCRIPTION:NOTE: Car parking may be limited in Etienne Brule park\, but a
 dditional space is usually available across the river in Kingsmill Park (0
 .5km away). The ride starts from the parking lot in Etienne Brule park (do
 wn the hill and over the river from Old Mill TTC station) and follows the 
