 starts out on the Finch Hydro Corridor path\, then takes Hidden Trail in G
  Ross Lord Park. After crossing Steeles Ave\, you ride on Bartley Smith Gr
 eenway\, following the Don River West Branch\, all the way north to Langst
 aff Road. Add in a few streets and some more of the Greenway\, and you are
  close to the bakery. The return trip from the bakery to Finch Station is 
 closer to the customary route on streets. Note: the Greenway is mainly unp
 aved varying from hardpack to loose gravel. Start : Meet at Finch Station 
