DESCRIPTION:Saturday Morning at Tigchelaar Farm We ride on some of the nic
 est backroads in Escarpment Country\, and then arrive at the park-like Tig
 chelaar Farm Market. This farm market has plenty of outdoor tables and cha
 irs under a canopy of trees. They have coffee made from direct-trade Nicar
 aguan beans that they roast on-site. They have butter tarts\, fruit pastri
 es\, and scones. Their story spans the Netherlands\, Canada\, and Nicaragu
 a. Take a look at Jo Koga's blog on this ride - click here . This ride tak
 es us from the Campbellville CarPool lot to Puslinch through the rolling c
 ountryside around Campbellville. Lunch is at the Tigchelaar Farm Market (2
 68 Puslinch Townline Rd.\, tel: 905-659-3659. Open F...
